            status: "general", src: "In re Winship (1970); Patterson v. New York, 432 U.S. 197 (1977); Mullaney v. Wilbur (1975); Martin v. Ohio (1987); Sandstrom v. Montana (1979); County Court of Ulster County v. Allen (1979); Jackson v. Virginia (1979); Lego v. Twomey (1972); crim.md §13.1",
